one と前提が違うのかもしれない。","ts":"1633521013.114900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"owj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"896b6874-87d6-46de-a1b2-d85326746654","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あとTextEditの展開がおかしいのもどちらを弄るべきか","ts":"1633520945.114300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XXyi0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc1d1e69-b91d-4160-bb83-2ab98ee03ab1","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"スニペット展開してそのままnormalに戻ってundoしてinsertに入って候補選択でundoが壊れる\npum側のundojoinでエラー吐いてるっぽい","ts":"1633520907.113900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dYqR6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4fa97e65-b2a6-465c-9c18-e028f3873d03","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あのサンプル設定で問題ないと思ったのですが。","ts":"1633520846.112600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rxnr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79588583-eebe-4d2d-8c22-4fd5c375df40","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"うーん。なんでだろう。ちょっと見てみますね。","ts":"1633520821.112100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5BKm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad931a69-c6ad-4510-9e0a-be43f4a79bb2","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あとスニペット展開した後のundoも動作がおかしいな\nうーん、関数を単純に埋めこめばいい系ではなかったかもしれない","ts":"1633520802.111800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DIEC3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5279eece-2966-4fba-9010-8e5f89831568","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"自動 import に関してはないと死ぬ系の機能だなあ。。。","ts":"1633520778.111300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IOY+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02388b0a-3604-4717-afc6-35144044dc26","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"これはもう少し深掘りし