-integにPR出してみました\nddc + pum.vimを使うときの設定ですが、一応は非公開な関数を使ってるのがネック","ts":"1633518489.101200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"INJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecc22e68-13aa-4d85-99f0-cb030dccc379","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ほー...でも納得しにくいなあw","ts":"1633517887.099500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8=7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8993073-19e7-4377-83ed-47747d9460e7","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"vim-lsp は v:completed_item が TextEdit のあとに消えてないか？をチェックするテストがあったりしますし。。。","ts":"1633517673.099100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mCz8J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4015646c-5d39-4f94-bd56-e662c79b167f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"おそらくバグではないんだと思います。意図して残るようになっている感じがしていて、ただ、自分も理由はわかっていません。","ts":"1633517653.098600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rJXWJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85aab6c4-0c13-4dc7-a014-2135439ddd6b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"えぇ…。","ts":"1633517181.098000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zIrHr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9729bebd-dcbe-40c0-aa70-bfaa0877eb8e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"それ本体バグな気がしますねえ \u0026gt; なかなか消えない","ts":"1633517078.097800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=fl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff3b3dde-c4a2-4a16-844d-b17eb07f7553","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"こんなかんじでした","ts":"1633516880.097500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YooK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d578a602-b0ce-48b8-9751-9e152ae0d719","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"1. 普通の CompleteDone はめちゃくちゃ大量に発生する\n2. 大量の CompleteDone のうち、採用したいのは「v:completed_item が存在する場合」だけ\n3. v:completed_item はなぜかなかなか消えてくれない（一度補完を確定すると、次の補完が確定されたり中止されたりしないと消えない）\n4. そのため、CompleteDonePre を見る実装が追加で入った","ts":"1633516873.097300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2c/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e147a9c-2127-4dc1-8dca-e812eac99fb0","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あー、普通のCompleteDoneは文字を入力するたびに走ってるんだった\npumはそんな事なさそうなので別にいらないか","ts":"1633515314.095600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kDy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"624ab34b-581b-4f8f-ac93-ba0d7dda400d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"vim-snip-integがここを見て分岐してるので合わせようと思ったんですが、そうする合理的理由が分かってないのでもしかしたらそこまで気にしなくてもいいのかもしれない","ts":"1633515029.094700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yU="}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9f19389-1285-4e42-b666-4713a849eb9e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"うーん、微妙に評価タイミングが違いそう\n`CompleteDonePre` から呼ばれた関数で `complete_info()` の `mode` を覗くとモードが入ってるんですよね","ts":"1633514980.093900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Hb0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2f9022c-a949-44a9-9749-289e34ca4793","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"なるほど、消えないならこのままでいけそう\nvim-vsnip-integ側はドキュメント書くだけでいけるかな","ts":"1633513593.092100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nt5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5637068d-4936-40dc-b6b3-2210e7660058","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"消えませんね","ts":"1633511777.091000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"24PX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3630f60c-fc66-4925-9b5a-53112d192e1b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"消えるようなら同時に `PumCompleteDonePre` を生や